# The one fatal error a plant built by 0.19.0 or earlier reports: its silo face is the retired
# plumbing frontage, which conflicts with the point-of-use layout cell for cell. %s = the tier
# measured off the standing walls.
beyondthestars.structure.silo.standing=Tier %s Reactor Silo is standing but not formed: the first wrong cell is listed above. Built on 0.19.0 or older? Run /btsmigrate beside the controller.
beyondthestars.gui.throttle.tooltip=Rods N/24 set reactor power (24/24 = 100%). A Programmed Circuit in the controller overrides this field.
beyondthestars.gui.throttle.milestone=Settings above 24/24 need the BURNUP milestones (T5 26/24, T6 28/24, T7 30/24) and the Upgrade Tree's rod nodes (Rod Seals, Deep Burn Profile, Overpower Licence: +2 each, up to 36/24). Until then the field clamps to what the plant has unlocked.
beyondthestars.gui.rpmlimit.tooltip=The redline the turbine is held to. 12,000 RPM is the design limit and the default.
beyondthestars.gui.rpmlimit.milestone=Settings above 12,000 need the TURBINE milestones (T5 13,500, T6 15,000) and the Upgrade Tree's Overspeed Certification (+10%) and Synchronous Condenser (+20%), up to 19,500. Coolant draw grows with the square of RPM: raise this only once the Spiral chamber can cool it, or the coolant interlock refuses cycles.
# D-24: the upgrade tree button in the controller's gap row.
beyondthestars.gui.tree.title=Upgrade Tree
beyondthestars.gui.tree.tooltip=Spend the points the milestone lines pay out: 25 nodes, 112 points, four branches (one per milestone line, opened by that line's tiers).
beyondthestars.gui.tree.refund=Left-click: buy. Right-click: refund (free; refused only while another node you hold hangs off it).
beyondthestars.gui.buildtier.tooltip=The Reactor Silo tier the hologram projector builds. A trigger stack of 2-5 overrides this. A standing silo is never re-tiered: dismantle it first.

